00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:45.400
Her first time in the forest was not only fun, but scary as well.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:52.280
Ronja, having learned from Lovis and Mattis that the best way to stay safe is not to be scared,

00:01:52.560 --> 00:02:00.540
kept watching out for what was dangerous and practiced being brave.

