00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.970
You're a storm-night child.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.710
And a witch-night child too.

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:18.720
You're born that way, so I understand that you can sometimes be a bit reckless.

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:23.310
But even so, don't get caught by a harpy.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.040
Just be careful of that.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.460
Dad was saying the same thing too.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:34.190
Harpies are among the most dangerous things in the forest.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:41.820
That's right, and when autumn comes the harpies become more aggressive.

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.240
A human...

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.500
In the gray dwarves' forest...

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:31.170
Disappear, gray dwarves!

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.500
Go to hell!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:30.270
Where is that pretty little human?

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:33.310
It's time for her blood to run!

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.820
Where is the little human?

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:48.150
Come out so we can tear you apart!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.980
I won't be able to stay in the forest at this rate.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.110
But there's so much time until nightfall...

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.420
That's right!

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:11.300
I wonder what Ronja is doing now.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:15.690
Let's hope she's not pushing herself too hard.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.390
Hell's gap.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:58.750
By the way, Ronja, do you remember what I told you?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:04.500
Be careful not to fall into Hell's gap.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:50.430
I can't be scared!

00:21:57.980 --> 00:22:00.470
I can't jump from here, I won't make it.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:12.800
From here I can make it.

00:22:31.580 --> 00:22:37.730
According to Lovis, Ronja was the only child in the forest...

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:40.390
but there were plenty of children in other places,

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:41.970
and when they grew up,

00:22:41.970 --> 00:22:47.620
there were some who turned out like Mattis, and some who turned out like Lovis.

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:54.210
The boy on the other side was the type to turn into a Mattis.

00:22:58.010 --> 00:23:02.410
Hey, bandit girl. I already know who you are.

00:23:03.730 --> 00:23:06.070
Then who are you?

